Another attempt with the luscious vocals of Elias Nego. I actually played the guitar on this. Not sure whether to admit that or not. I am alternately horrified and liking the way it sounds. And not just *any* guitar, but my new Guild blonde hollow-body. Can you tell I&#8217;m in lurve?<br />
<br />
I fully intend to finish this song with lyrics and an English vocal, where the chorus is &#8220;I want to waylay you &#8230;. Don&#8217;t try to stop me.&#8221;
